{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-09_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-09","title":"Bad to the Bone","storyCode":"4-9","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"3b8a15412b80c943803ceef1b049a68b58a63ccae3d56ce6ca39af9eb49f43ae","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Despite the momentum of Amiya's team, Mephisto seems to face no pressure at all.\nRight when Mephisto is about to be struck, the entire world freezes over in the blink of an eye. FrostNova has arrived.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf, watch out! Don't rush so far forward!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I know what I'm doing!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaah! Aaaagghhh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"She sliced through the shield using a blade of frigid air?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Wh-what?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Get lost!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Frostleaf has broken the enemy's formation, and is now charging towards their commander!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Snipers, casters, I need you to cover Frostleaf!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Ohh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"And just what do you want, little fox?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I want you to scream and beg. I want you to pay..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...with your life."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Out of my way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Woah!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"B-Black Arts..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"H-hurry, run for it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want to end up like Mephisto's minions...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Mephisto, we're not letting you get away!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Heh. I should have guessed that these goons weren't enough to stop you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You're going to pay for what you've done, you sick bastard!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"You can't escape."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Little fox, you're getting a bit too close for comfort."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Because I am the one who will take your life."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Those who do not respect the sanctity of life..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Do not deserve on of their own."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Hehhh..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Is that so."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"What... My feet...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Reunion forces are appearing from all directions! Even though there aren't a lot of them..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh no, it's the Yeti Squadron..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"They've all... come together!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, I need to introduce you to a new friend."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Ahem~ Next up, put your hands together for the real star of the show..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"The nightmare of the northwest tundra, the master of the Yetis..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss... Frost... Novaaaaaaa!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"She will freeze every bit of your flesh, every drop of your blood..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Bit. By. Bit!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...We need to get out of here...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Mephisto..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I should have left you to slowly freeze to death in the tundra like the psychopath you are."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh my, scary, scary~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"But Rhodes Island is right in front of us."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Back up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya, take them with you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I refuse!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That person... that person is...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"She's... coming towards me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't win."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah... Even though I would've liked to live a bit longer..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm glad that I had the chance to meet all of you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry, Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll give you a painless death."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["FrostNova"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["Mephisto"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["Meteorite"]}]}
